[[File:ItFMenuButton.png|thumb]]
'''Into the Future''' (未来編, ''Mirai-hen'', '''Future Arc'''), commonly shortened to ItF, is the second saga in [[The Battle Cats]] and is unlocked after clearing Chapter 1 of [[Empire of Cats]]. This mode contains 3 additional chapters, with 48 levels in each once again. This mode also introduces [[Timed Stage Reward|Timed Score Rewards]], in which you gain bonus rewards depending on how quickly you complete a stage.

The main gimmick of this saga is the debut of [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien Enemies]]; they are extremely strong, don't give much cash, and have a 700% strength magnification by default, which can only be reduced by the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|anti-Alien Crystals]] you may obtain as [[Treasure]].

The deployment cost for [[:Category:Cat Units|Cat Units]] is that of [[Legend Stages]] and EoC Chapter 2, which means you pay 1.5x for the base price of a unit. Chapters 2 and 3 don't change the price.

[[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] brought [[Zombie Outbreaks]] to Chapter 1, [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] brought them to Chapter 2, and [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] brought them to Chapter 3.

==Story==
In Into the Future, the Cats have time travelled from [[Empire of Cats]] to the far future, when hostile [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] who arrived on April 1st, 29XX have invaded every country on Earth. After stopping the invasion and defeating the Aliens, it is revealed that a rocket is being built by the Cats, alluding to [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. Unlike Empire of Cats, the [[The Battle Cats|English]] and [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese]] versions of Into the Future take place across the same locations.

In all versions except the English Version, the year the Aliens landed on Earth is 900 years ahead of whatever year the device's clock is set to. For example, if the current year is {{CURRENTYEAR}}, the opening will say the Aliens arrived in {{#expr:{{CURRENTYEAR}}+900}}.

