==Chapter 1: Time Enough for Cats==
[[File:ItF1MenuButton.png|thumb]]
(にゃんこ軍団日本侵略！！ ''Nyanko Gundan Sekai Shinryaku!!'', '''Cat Army Invading the World!!''')
*Aliens in this chapter have a strength magnification of 100%. Other enemies' buffs vary but are generally comparable to early [[Stories of Legend]].
*The final boss of this chapter is [[Cli-One]], with a wave of Alien peons.
*Players receive 50 [[Cat Food]] and unlock additional [[Cat Combo]]s upon completion.
*Completing this chapter also unlocks [[Cats of the Cosmos]].
*Obtaining all Superior [[Treasure]]s in this chapter awards 1,500,000 XP.
*After beating the chapter, [[Ashvini Desert]] gets unlocked.

==Chapter 2: Alien Intrigue - A Maiden's Revenge==
[[File:ItF2MenuButton.png|thumb]]
(エイリアンの陰謀！反逆の戦乙女 ''Eirian no Inbō! Hangyaku no Ikusa Otome'', '''Alien Intrigue! A War Maiden's Rebellion''')
*Aliens introduced in this chapter have a strength magnification of 100%.
*Old Aliens not introduced in this chapter have a strength magnification of 250%. Other enemies' buffs are comparable to [[Silk Road|sub-chapter 20]] or so.
*The final boss of this chapter is [[Corrupted Valkyrie]], with a stronger wave of Alien peons.
*Players receive 50 Cat Food and unlock [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]'s [[True Form]] upon completion. She gains a ~50% attack boost, and a 35% chance to freeze all non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies for 2 seconds.
*Completing this chapter also unlocks another set of Cat Combos.
*Obtaining all Superior Treasures in this chapter awards 2,000,000 XP.

==Chapter 3: The Ancients Arise: Take Back Earth!==
[[File:ItF3MenuButton.png|thumb]]
(超古代兵器の暴走!取り戻せ地球!! ''Chō Kodai Heiki no Bōsō! Torimodose Chikyū!!'', '''The Super Ancient Weapon's Rampage! Take Back Earth!!''')
*Aliens introduced in this chapter have a strength magnification of 100%-300%.
*Old Aliens not introduced in this chapter have a strength magnification of 500%-1,000%. Other enemies' buffs are around [[Body & Soul|sub-chapter 27]] levels.
*The final boss of this chapter is [[Raging Bahamut Cat]], with an even stronger wave of Alien peons.
*Players receive 100 Cat Food and unlock [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]'s True Form upon completion. He becomes more of a kamikaze unit, with extraordinarily high DPS, insane movement speed and much more frequent attacks. However, his range is greatly reduced in this form.
*Completing this chapter also unlocks [[Talents]], NP, [[Talent Orbs]] and another set of Cat Combos.
*Obtaining all Superior Treasures in this chapter awards 2,500,000 XP.
*After beating the chapter, [[Jinfore Volcano]] gets unlocked.

